5,Folk Music of the Western Congo - Smithsonian Folkways Recordings,https://folkways.si.edu/folk-music-of-the-western-congo/world/album/smithsonian,"Folk Music of the Western Congo presents music from the Bantu-speaking tribes of Western Congo. Included is a Bambala litigation proceeding, which requires litigants to both speak and sing their case to the village chief.",Mbala,Niger-Congo
6,Qui sont les Mbala ? - Archives Mbala,https://www.archivesmbala.org/index.php/qui-sont-les-mbala/,"Qui sont les Mbala ? Les Mbala résident en espaces provinciaux des Bandundu (locuteurs des variantes du Kimbala) et Kasaï-Occidental (locuteurs des variantes du Tshimbala), en République Démocratique du Congo.",Mbala,Niger-Congo
